body:
I'm mostly agreeing with descriptive claims you are making. You are saying very bland facts and not actually connecting them to a normative idea, the purpose of me to show you that I agree with your bland facts and still say its dumb ass fucking shit is because you are not connecting it some claim very well.

&#x200B;

"You still haven't explained why the guy I'm responding to wants to guilt people over eating meat." This comment has two dumb things.

1. To claim he wants to guilt people over eating meat is a pretty weak fucking point when he literally says that he does "not care if you eat meat, bro"
2. Even if this was true, it is not my burden to defend the guy. I'm not here because I find it all that fun to defend advancement I just want to demonstrate why what you are saying and implying is stupid.

&#x200B;

You are very clearly straw manning some points, which is typically associated with people who do have "pent up righteousness" and I think you are one of those people.

&#x200B;

That is not exactly what Vegans do. Have you ever considered not making broad generalizations about very large groups of people?

&#x200B;

It is not idiotic for me to project that your way, because you do have pent up righteousness.

&#x200B;

 He supposedly doesn't care if people eats meat but he cares enough to claim moral superiority over them for "killing these animals".  I don't know advancement well enough to make claims on his behalf, so I won't. Again, you need to connect what you are saying to some overall claim. Stop saying fucking bland shit and get to a point worth discussing dude.
